
Transfer 

    init

        requires connection

    is remote dir

        returns bool of stat ISDIR flag
        returns False if stat raises IOError

    get

        basics

            accepts single remote path posarg
            accepts local and remote kwargs
            returns rich Result object

        path arg edge cases

            local None uses remote filename
            local empty string uses remote filename
            remote arg is required
            remote arg cannot be None
            remote arg cannot be empty string

        file like local paths

            remote path to local StringIO
            result contains fd for local path

        mode concerns

            preserves remote mode by default
            allows disabling remote mode preservation

    put

        basics

            accepts single local path posarg
            accepts local and remote kwargs
            returns rich Result object

        remote end is directory

            appends local file basename

            file like local objects

                name attribute present appends like basename
                no name attribute raises ValueError

        path arg edge cases

            remote None uses local filename
            remote empty string uses local filename
            remote cant be empty if local file like
            local arg is required
            local arg cannot be None
            local arg cannot be empty string

        file like local paths

            remote path from local StringIO
            local FLOs are rewound before putting
            result contains fd for local path

        mode concerns

            preserves local mode by default
            allows disabling local mode preservation

Group 

