SerialGroup 

    run

        executes arguments on contents run serially
        errors in execution capture and continue til end
        returns results mapping

ThreadingGroup 

    run

        executes arguments on contents run via threading
        queue used to return results
        bubbles up errors within threads
        returns results mapping

