    has various Fabric specific default keys
    overrides some Invoke defaults
    uses Fabric prefix

ssh config loading

    defaults to empty sshconfig obj if no files found
    object can be given explicitly via ssh config kwarg
    when config obj given default paths are not sought
    config obj prevents loading runtime path too
    when runtime path given other paths are not sought
    runtime path can be given via config itself
    runtime path does not die silently
    default file paths match openssh
    system path loads ok
    user path loads ok
    both paths loaded if both exist with user winning
    runtime path subject to user expansion
    user path subject to user expansion

    core ssh load option allows skipping ssh config loading

        skips default paths
        does not affect explicit object
        does not skip loading runtime path

    lazy loading and explicit methods

        may use lazy plus explicit methods to control flow
